@start_menu_2

= Thunderous Applause

*An Alternate History of the Galactic Republic*

{!<div class="crawl">!}It is a period of decline for the Galactic Republic. A thousand years after the Ruusan Reformation ended the last war with the Sith, the Senate has grown vast, slow and corrupt. The great trade guilds buy votes by the hundred. The Outer Rim is ignored, taxed and plundered by pirates. And somewhere in the shadows, an ancient enemy has begun to stir...{!</div>!}

- @new_game: Begin a new game
